Z||000000||btoth||11-02-2000||03:37 PM||||My driver side seat back moves about an inch or so nomatter how I have it reclined when i push against it.  Passanger side doesn't give at all.  Is this just from old age and wear on the reclining mechanism?  And is there a simple way of fixing it other than finding a replacment? TIA.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Indiana_resto_guy||11-02-2000||05:53 PM||||Make sure that all your bolts that hold the back on are tight. Other wise you need a new (or different) mechanism. ||||reg||1
